    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873240/extras/f1a4cbf262f656729771443276cc9997.avif?t=1741446950\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udca3 Bomberrage \u2013 Explosive Multiplayer Battles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overview:</strong> Step into the chaos of <strong>Bomberrage</strong>, a fast-paced, action-packed multiplayer game where strategy and reflexes decide who survives! Battle against smart AI or challenge friends in explosive skirmishes, where every second counts!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Intense Multiplayer Battles</strong> \u2013 Face off against AI or real players in dynamic bomb fights!<br>\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Challenging AI Opponents</strong> \u2013 Adapt and outsmart relentless enemies!<br>\ud83d\uddfa <strong>Ever-Changing Arenas</strong> \u2013 Procedurally generated maps keep battles fresh!<br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>Easy to Pick Up, Hard to Master</strong> \u2013 Fun for casual players, rewarding for competitive ones!<br>\ud83c\udfac <strong>Epic Cinematics &amp; Unique Characters</strong> \u2013 Explosions have never looked this good!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873240/extras/f1a4cbf262f656729771443276cc9997.avif?t=1741446950\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udca3 Bomberrage \u2013 Explosive Multiplayer Battles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overview:</strong> Step into the chaos of <strong>Bomberrage</strong>, a fast-paced, action-packed multiplayer game where strategy and reflexes decide who survives! Battle against smart AI or challenge friends in explosive skirmishes, where every second counts!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Intense Multiplayer Battles</strong> \u2013 Face off against AI or real players in dynamic bomb fights!<br>\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Challenging AI Opponents</strong> \u2013 Adapt and outsmart relentless enemies!<br>\ud83d\uddfa <strong>Ever-Changing Arenas</strong> \u2013 Procedurally generated maps keep battles fresh!<br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>Easy to Pick Up, Hard to Master</strong> \u2013 Fun for casual players, rewarding for competitive ones!<br>\ud83c\udfac <strong>Epic Cinematics &amp; Unique Characters</strong> \u2013 Explosions have never looked this good!</p>",
